OL,3,GNEWSARural areas may suffer in merger,
OL,4,Apolice chief warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police chief has warned that plans to
OL,7,Freduce the number of forces in England
OL,8,Fand Wales could cause rural communities
OL,9,Fto suffer.
OL,11,FMetropolitan Police commissioner Sir
OL,12,FMark Rowley has proposed the current
OL,13,F43-force structure is cut to between
OL,14,Feight and 10 regional constabularies.
OL,16,FSuffolk's Conservative police and crime
OL,17,Fcommissioner, Tim Passmore, told the
OL,18,FSuffolk Police and Crime Panel he was
OL,19,Funconvinced the plans would deliver
OL,20,Fbetter outcomes.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
