OL,3,GNEWSARural areas may suffer in merger,
OL,4,Apolice chief warns
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Resources and decision-making could
OL,7,Fincreasingly be concentrated in major
OL,8,Furban centres, leaving rural counties
OL,9,Fsuch as Suffolk and Norfolk at risk of
OL,10,Flosing influence and visibility," he
OL,11,Fsaid.
